// The build-only topology composer: `build.omg` imports the `topology`
// package through a build-scope alias, reads the committed `inputs/`, and
// publishes `payments.plan` as the required output of an artifact-only
// application build. Product sources hold no dependency imports: `topology`
// is authorized only in the build scope. TOPOLOGY-PLAN-VERIFICATION owns this
// case; BUILD-SNAPSHOT-OUTPUTS owns the output facets it calls.
//
// `omega --check` at 42db5b1ac3a rejects with 32 diagnostics, all arity
// mismatches on the Build facet calls (`builder.log.write_line`,
// `builder.output.require/resolve/create/close/complete`, and the source
// facet's `open/read/close` inside `topology/compose.omg`), for example
// "state `resolve` expects 2 argument(s), got 1": the composer still spells
// the facets as receiver calls the current Build surface does not provide.
machine main() {}
